WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.585 --> 00:00:12.345
I don't know how you done it all these years.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:15.705
Seeing all the things ya seen and doin all the things you done.

00:00:16.265 --> 00:00:19.485
Makes ya feel, inhuman after a while.

00:00:22.005 --> 00:00:24.395
Captain you do know, Chief Yellow Hawk?

00:00:25.015 --> 00:00:31.715
The army wants to be certain that the Chief gets home to Montana safely, without incident.

00:00:31.715 --> 00:00:34.000
You have any idea, what he's done?

00:00:35.955 --> 00:00:36.955
He's a butcher.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.120
Then the two of you ought to get along just fine.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.840
I've killed savages, cause that's my job.

00:00:44.475 --> 00:00:47.625
You have no idea what war does to a man.

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:49.875
I hate him.

00:00:50.735 --> 00:00:54.000
I got a warbag of reasons to hate him.

00:00:54.155 --> 00:00:55.435
This will be done.

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:58.000
And it will be done by you.

00:00:59.405 --> 00:01:00.365
Parades over.

00:01:00.995 --> 00:01:02.325
Put em in chains.

00:01:06.785 --> 00:01:08.485
You believe in the lord, Joseph?

00:01:11.685 --> 00:01:13.575
Yes I do.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:19.080
But he's been blind to what's going on out here for a long time.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.800
If I did not have faith,

00:01:24.665 --> 00:01:25.875
What would I have?

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:41.225
You know I've killed everything that's walked or crawled.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.540
If you do it enough, you get used to it.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.000
That's what I'm afraid of.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.000
You just gotta take your dues.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.800
We both know it could just as easily be you sitting here in these chains.

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.900
Sometimes I envy the finality of death.

00:02:01.235 --> 00:02:01.735
The certainty.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:07.300
And I have to drive those thoughts away when I'm weak.

00:02:19.725 --> 00:02:21.255
Understand this.

00:02:21.705 --> 00:02:24.145
When we lay our heads down out here,

00:02:25.435 --> 00:02:26.825
we're all prisoners.

